{"id":289,"doub_id":289,"title":"兵临城下","years":"2001","class":"剧情","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1591033712.webp","doub_score":8.4,"IMDB_number":"","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"","bianji":"[]","performer":"","language":"","release":"","alias":"","abstract":"斯大林格勒战役中，瓦西里（裘德•洛 Jude Law 饰）是一个威震部队的神枪手。他的好枪法百发百中，令敌人闻风丧胆。\n　　为了激励士气，树立榜样，瓦西里的战友——苏军文宣部军官丹尼洛夫（约瑟夫•费因斯 Joseph Fiennes 饰）在报纸上大量刊登瓦西里的英雄事迹，令瓦西里的形象更为高大。然而，坦妮娅（雷切尔•薇姿 Rachel Weisz 饰）的出现，让瓦西里和丹尼洛夫都同时迷恋上了这个飒爽女兵。但塔妮娅喜欢的是瓦西里，这让丹尼洛夫大为妒忌。\n　　另一方面，德军派出了他们的狙击手康尼（艾德•哈里斯 Ed Harris 饰），让同是神枪手的他抗衡瓦西里。在硝烟弥漫的战场上，瓦西里和康尼开始了斗智斗勇的决斗。 ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2180639651.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p969001807.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1591033712.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1802984410.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1xS2jKm8H-rF1jsYl11GlzA?pwd=d32p\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-06-26\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0},{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/11eHCN_5ClXJwOlulW0Ln3Q?pwd=b4sk\",\"size\":\"1.66\",\"date\":\"2025-06-26\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 爱尔兰 / 英国 / 法国 / 德国 / 美国","orginName":"《兵临城下 Enemy at the Gates》","ratingbetterthan":"","tag":""}